# One-time manual setup — run with /function virtues:npc/tag_all_trinsic_npcs
# after placing/naming Trinsic's NPCs (NBT_Creator/NBT_world2, during
# Trinsic.nbt authoring). Tags each named villager npc_<name> for
# trade-completion advancement matching and general re-identification if the
# town has to be rebuilt from scratch.

